        },
        {
          "title": "Appearance",
          "lines": [
            "A short-legged, wiry-coated hound with a deep chest, thick neck, and short, powerful muzzle."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Traits mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Beast of Burden · Treat the storgin as Large when calculating carrying capacity.",
            "Heightened Hearing and Smell · Perception is 18 for hearing or smell.",
            "Sunlight Sensitivity · While in sunlight, the storgin has disadvantage on attack rolls and its Perception is 8 for sight."
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Actions mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Bite · +4 to hit · reach 5 ft. · One target takes 4 (1d4 + 2) piercing damage on a hit. A Medium or smaller creature is grappled on a hit (escape DC 12). The storgin cannot bite another target until this grapple ends. · 1d4 + 2 piercing"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Reactions mechanics",
          "lines": [
            "Crushing Jaws · When a creature it is grappling hits it, the storgin can squeeze its jaws to deal 4 (1d4 + 2) piercing damage to that creature. · 1d4 + 2 piercing"
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Table notes",
          "lines": [
            "Printed Perception 13, Stealth 12. Ability modifiers are Str +2, Dex +2, Con +2, Int −4, Wis +1, Cha −2.",
            "Gnomish handlers train storgins to carry packs and haul wagons. The stone-eating story is a legend."
          ]
        }
